    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Plenty of Fish in the Sea</i>, you dive into the serene, shimmering waters of a peaceful river, where the salmon are not just fish but charming, chatty companions with unique personalities, dreams, and dating preferences. As a friendly aquatic matchmaker (and potential love interest), you\u2019ll engage in heartwarming conversations with a diverse cast of salmon, from poetic deep-thinkers to adventurous thrill-seekers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim through winding streams, moonlit waterfalls, and cozy underwater grottos as you take your fishy friends on delightful dates\u2014whether it\u2019s a scenic drift downriver, a romantic algae-tasting picnic, or a playful game of leaping over waterfalls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With colorful visuals, a soothing soundtrack of bubbling brooks and gentle chiptune melodies, and branching dialogue choices that shape your relationships, <i>Plenty of Fish in the Sea</i> is a cozy, feel-good experience about connection, companionship, and the simple joys of swimming side by side. Will you find your perfect fishy match?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Plenty of Fish in the Sea</i>, you dive into the serene, shimmering waters of a peaceful river, where the salmon are not just fish but charming, chatty companions with unique personalities, dreams, and dating preferences. As a friendly aquatic matchmaker (and potential love interest), you\u2019ll engage in heartwarming conversations with a diverse cast of salmon, from poetic deep-thinkers to adventurous thrill-seekers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim through winding streams, moonlit waterfalls, and cozy underwater grottos as you take your fishy friends on delightful dates\u2014whether it\u2019s a scenic drift downriver, a romantic algae-tasting picnic, or a playful game of leaping over waterfalls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With colorful visuals, a soothing soundtrack of bubbling brooks and gentle chiptune melodies, and branching dialogue choices that shape your relationships, <i>Plenty of Fish in the Sea</i> is a cozy, feel-good experience about connection, companionship, and the simple joys of swimming side by side. Will you find your perfect fishy match?</p>",
    "short_description": "Plenty of Fish in the Sea is a cozy narrative-driven dating sim where you engage in heartfelt conversations with charming salmon and take them on delightful underwater dates.",
